                  <photoshop:LayerText>   Level Designer                                                            June - 4 Weeks   Castor et lâ€™Ã‰cureuil                                  Narrative Platformer - Unreal Engine - 14 people     - Level intentions and conception     - Creation and formalization of the Level Design Document     - In charge of the blocking and modifications after various QA sessions     - Conception of cinematic in game and out game      - Game Design Document formalisation   Level Designer                                                       February - 3 Weeks   MadMax: Fury Rogue                             Rogue - Unity - 15 people     - Level intentions and conception with another Level Designer     - In charge of the blocking     - Creation and formalisation of the Level Design Document  Lead Game Designer - Level Designer                               November - 3 Weeks   HellStorm                                 Arcade Racer - Unreal Engine - 14 people    - Level intentions and conception       - In charge of the blocking    - Creation and formalisation of the Level Design Document </photoshop:LayerText>
